OL,3,GNEWSAMore buses to return after
OL,4,Aoperator ceased trading
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore bus routes are set to be brought
OL,7,Fback into service after an operator
OL,8,Fceased trading and made the majority of
OL,9,Fstaff redundant.
OL,11,FCommunity Transport for Nottingham
OL,12,F(CT4N), which had run more than 20
OL,13,Froutes, said on 14 August that steps
OL,14,Fwere being taken to place the firm
OL,15,Fformally into administration.
OL,17,FIt has now been confirmed that Littles
OL,18,FTravel will take on the firm's 29
OL,19,Fservice between Long Eaton and
OL,20,FSandiacre, the 510 serving Beeston,
OL,21,FToton, Attenborough and Stapleford, and
OL,22,Fthe 511 circular Stapleford service.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
