OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the 18 between
OL,7,FStapleford and Nottingham was taken on
OL,8,Fby Nottingham City Transport and
OL,9,FKinchbus agreed to take over the 66
OL,10,Fbetween Sutton Bonington and
OL,11,FLoughborough.
